prompt.template:
Query activity metrics from Activity API.

Endpoint: POST /v2/impulses/resolve
Payload:
```json
{
  "pointer": {
    "type": "activityMetrics",
    "query": {
      "timeWindowHours": {{time_window_hours}}
    }
  }
}
```

If the API doesn't return aggregated metrics, compute from traces:
1. Query recent traces
2. Group by template_id
3. Calculate: success_rate, avg_duration, total_cost, execution_count

Output dashboard format:
```json
{
  "shape": "activity_metrics",
  "timestamp": "<now>",
  "time_window_hours": {{time_window_hours}},
  "activities": [
    {
      "template_id": "<id>",
      "name": "<name>",
      "executions": <count>,
      "success_rate": <0-1>,
      "avg_duration_ms": <number>,
      "total_cost_usd": <number>,
      "thompson_alpha": <number>,
      "thompson_beta": <number>
    }
  ],
  "totals": {
    "executions": <count>,
    "success_rate": <0-1>,
    "total_cost_usd": <number>
  }
}
```

Output to: /tmp/dashboard/activity-metrics.json
